          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can you build an accessible site for federal clients?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We can. We build to WCAG 2.1 AA, which covers the WCAG 2.0 AA standard Section 508 refers to, and test with a keyboard and a screen reader before launch."
